{"id":18482966119,"name":"Horizon Blue: 1919","desc":"GAME IS IN ALPHA\n\nThe Horizon has never been so dull, a landscape shattered by years of relentless artillery and broken promises. Verdun, once again, becomes the forefront of the War. The German war machine thrusts inward into the ravaged citadel of France, seeking a final, decisive blow...\n\nIn The War That Ended All Wars, history fractures. Step into the muddied boots of weary yet unbroken infantrymen in a brutal, lengthy player-driven campaign. Will you push the offensive and carve a path through Verdun—or stand your ground as the fiercest bastion of Allied resistance against the German Army.\n\nCONTROLS:\nWASD - Move\nL. CTRL - Mouse lock\nQE - Switch Shoulder View\nBV - Equip & Arm Bayonet\nTab F8 F10 - Scoreboard, Settings & Info\nM1 M2 - Fire, Aim\nM1 - While loop reloading: Cancel\nR - Reload, Detonate\nZ - Toggle aim\nP - Mute Music\n\nDesktop Recommended. Performances settings in F8 menu.\nCredits in-game, in the Info menu.\n\nFor any further inquiries, do not hesitate to contact me directly !","path":"/game/18482966119-horizon-blue-1919","slug":"18482966119-horizon-blue-1919","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/5898939416d64b8083537e66ef464ec49102adc851a012159bb26c9a97fb5dac.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a113731d26acb7b170eb82ad9d335ec9/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":33,"visitor":14216137,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-08-16T21:12:52.403Z","creator":{"name":"Artefact Pixel","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"6a8227d4fc79fd7eb040be5f","title":"| Horizon Blue 1919 | Silent Aim, ESP and MORE!","game":{"_id":"689e2c1aee292b5f8b02acf8","gameId":18482966119,"name":"Horizon Blue: 1919","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/5898939416d64b8083537e66ef464ec49102adc851a012159bb26c9a97fb5dac.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a113731d26acb7b170eb82ad9d335ec9/150/